{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vO7oqvMMia1795672218.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國聯邦地區法院裁定，禁止聯邦通訊委員會提前對美國廣播公司ABC進行續牌檢討。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.ABC-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZSr8Y4NEAj1795672212.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>ABC與母公司迪士尼8月入稟法院，要求基於保障言論自由的憲法第一修正案，對聯邦通訊委員會提前對ABC的8個電視台進行續牌檢討的決定，頒布臨時禁制令。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.ABC-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vVmXuzaZH01795672216.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國名嘴JIMMY KIMMEL，今年較早時在ABC的清談節目，取笑第一夫人梅拉尼亞。總統特朗普被指施壓聯邦通訊委員會，要求吊銷ABC的廣播牌照，指電視台的節目內容令人反感。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:42:05.767330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:14.242698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:35:27.416694+00:00","content_hash":"cc89849218884554534d975422ebdadbac9682a74f1a6c62972779b528b6e2ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:42:05.767330+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}